A massive mechanical robot stands motionless on the bridge that crosses the plaza.

NOTE extended pause=3.344

x014
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.844
The young man stands next to the robot on the bridge and stares at it.

NOTE extended pause=5.294

x019
